{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DYx5D6PZbvFyeQCzGv7TRa","type":"tool_result","content":"15:**Estado (2026-11-10):** os quatro milestones estão fechados com revisão independente\n16:(B32 operation-performance, B31 common-domain-handoff, B33 bounded-graph-caches e B35\n17:optional-worktree-runtime, esta em três fatias medidas), com o runtime opt-in e standalone\n37:[ADR de domínio/runtime Proposed](../adr/2026-10-14-shared-domain-and-optional-worktree-runtime.md).\n39:B31/B33 não exigem B35; runtime consome ambos após seus demais pré-requisitos.\n63:## Milestone: optional-worktree-runtime\n67:- specs: pose-optional-worktree-runtime, pose-worktree-runtime-resident-cache, pose-worktree-runtime-qos-and-measurement\n69:**Entrega (2026-11-10):** as três fatias estão fechadas (`pose-optional-worktree-runtime`,\n77:**Exit gate:** B35 qualifica handshake user/worktree/Git/engine/schema, endpoint"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"27ad5106-bcd6-4955-ab96-f3f65a14d03d","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:16:29.741Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"15:**Estado (2026-11-10):** os quatro milestones estão fechados com revisão independente\n16:(B32 operation-performance, B31 common-domain-handoff, B33 bounded-graph-caches e B35\n17:optional-worktree-runtime, esta em três fatias medidas), com o runtime opt-in e standalone\n37:[ADR de domínio/runtime Proposed](../adr/2026-10-14-shared-domain-and-optional-worktree-runtime.md).\n39:B31/B33 não exigem B35; runtime consome ambos após seus demais pré-requisitos.\n63:## Milestone: optional-worktree-runtime\n67:- specs: pose-optional-worktree-runtime, pose-worktree-runtime-resident-cache, pose-worktree-runtime-qos-and-measurement\n69:**Entrega (2026-11-10):** as três fatias estão fechadas (`pose-optional-worktree-runtime`,\n77:**Exit gate:** B35 qualifica handshake user/worktree/Git/engine/schema, endpoint","numLines":9,"totalLine